  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Fire Spread Tweaks 改變了遊戲中火焰的行為方式。<br><br>在原版遊戲中，當你把遊戲規則 'doFireTick' 設為 false 時，會阻止火焰蔓延，但這些火焰也會永遠燃燒不熄。我不希望我的建築被燒毀，但火焰也應該會熄滅，除非它位於下界岩、熔岩塊或靈魂沙上方。這就是為什麼我創建了這個模組。<br><br>該模組會在首次載入世界時將遊戲規則 'doFireTick' 設為 false，同時還擴充了此功能，讓火焰確實會熄滅。有多個設定檔選項，讓你能夠控制火焰應燃燒多久。預設情況下，火焰會隨機燃燒 10 到 20 秒。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"自訂選項\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>timeFireBurnsInTicks</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 300，最小 0，最大 72000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">火焰持續燃燒的刻數。20 刻 = 1 秒。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableRandomizedFireDuration</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，將使用 MinRandomExtraBurnTicks 和 MaxRandomExtraBurnTicks 設定值來隨機化火焰燃燒時間。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>minRandomExtraBurnTicks</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 -100，最小 -36000，最大 0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若已啟用隨機火焰持續時間，則會在最小值與最大值之間選擇一個隨機的刻數。這將加到 timeFireBurnsInTicks 上。若結果為負數，則會從中減去。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>maxRandomExtraBurnTicks</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 100，最小 0，最大 36000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">請參閱 MinRandomExtraBurnTicks 的說明。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"實機畫面\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>當火焰放置在下界岩、熔岩塊或靈魂沙上方時，它仍會永遠燃燒：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/fire-spread-tweaks/a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"538\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>樹木和其他方塊可以燃燒一段時間，但方塊不會被摧毀：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/fire-spread-tweaks/b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"570\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/fire-spread-tweaks/c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"570\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>火焰具有隨機燃燒時間：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/fire-spread-tweaks/d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載檔繼續託管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您就可以在任何整合包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在這麼多獨立的模組頁面中追蹤留言，因此已關閉留言功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
